Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/list.c
Line: 916
Function: collect_kem
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: sk_EVP_KEM_new() in list_kems() (line 923) is not checked for NULL. A NULL kem_stack is passed via EVP_KEM_do_all_provided() to collect_kem(), which then calls sk_EVP_KEM_push(kem_stack, kem) and dereferences the NULL pointer.

Source context:
```c
